**DIRAC
.TITLE
Carbon monoxide
.WAVE F
.ANALYZE
.PROPERTIES
**INTEGRALS
*READIN
.UNCONT
# uncontracting the basis set...
**HAMILTONIAN
.LVCORR
.DFT
B3LYP
**WAVE FUNCTIONS
.DHF
*DHFCAL
.CLOSED SHELL
14
**PROPERTIES
.RHONUC
*EXPECTATION VALUE
.ORBANA
**ANALYZE
#.RHO1
# uncomment the above keyword to get a formatted file RHC__1F__1
# of the electronic density along a line through the CO bond
# Four columns: 1) Coordinate in Angstrom
#               2) Total density
#               3) Large component density
#               4) Small component density
.MULPOP
*END OF


